`= title|plumb intentional diagnostics

This document is the only playground source expected to emit semantic diagnostics.
The CLI regression test fixes every code and keeps all other examples clean.

`# Links

`- Missing same-file anchor: `->[missing|#missing-anchor]
`- Missing document: `->[missing file|missing-target.plumb]

`# Duplicate anchor

`node First duplicate target.

 `@ duplicate-anchor

`node Second duplicate target.

 `@ duplicate-anchor

`# Invalid event

`- Event without a positional schedule and title

 `+ event

`# Images

`img[missing source]

`img[unresolved image|=[src|static/missing.png]]
